<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 1.0 billion Czech crown Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 1.0 billion Czech crown Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerzbank AG has launched a 1.0 billion Czech crown one-year Eurobond paying 11.50 percent and priced at 100.925, lead manager WoodCommerz said. </p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     11.50     MATURITY    17.OCT.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.925   PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 25-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CZ</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.75	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
